https://github.com/fcarsten/ffgraph

ffgraph is a C++ class library to create, manipulate and display
directed graphs. Access to the library is provided through the classes
described in doc/ffgraph.ps. Graphs can be loaded and saved in a
slightly extended sgraph file format.

It was originally created in the early 90s and recently ported to compile and run on modern Linux, namely Ubuntu 24.04.
